{"type": "say", "text": "Thanks, Marisol, and thanks everyone for being here. I appreciate being considered for this rotation. I think the employee-listening facilitator role is a really valuable initiative — giving teams a structured way to surface collaboration concerns before they escalate is important, and I'd be glad to contribute. I do have one scheduling constraint I'd like to put on the table before we go further, though, so that it's part of the discussion from the start."}
```

