{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF4", "text": "Before we go further, I want to share some important HR program guidance that applies to this rotation. Every employee-listening facilitator rotation must last exactly eight weeks, include written learning goals, and have a documented midpoint review on day 28. These requirements haven't yet been added to the draft plan, so I want to make sure they're part of our discussion today and reflected in whatever decision and support plan Marisol records at the end of this round."}
```

